  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCooPMA TANGUIETA Market Gardening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide appropriately sized pumping and water distribution systems that will reduce the amount of manual labor and facilitate more intensive management at the two sites totaling 4.8 hectares through installation of California-type irrigation systems, improved production management, and more effective cooperative financial and administrative services.</narrative>
  </description>
